  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>ReadAccessor is used to read file data. It provides binary and text mode methods for checking or getting the current byte/character (PeekByte/PeekChar, GetByte/GetChar) methods for reading a section of a binary/text file (Read Binary/ReadText), a method to read a line of text (ReadLine).</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
